## Migration rules

Everyone can run:
- alembic upgrade head (apply migrations to your local database after pulling)
- alembic current, alembic heads, alembic history (read-only checks)

Team lead only:
- alembic revision --autogenerate (create a migration)
- alembic merge heads
- alembic downgrade

Workflow:
1. Add your model in app/models/ and open a PR. Do not create a migration file.
2. The team lead merges the PR, generates the migration in a follow-up PR, and tells the team.
3. Everyone pulls and runs alembic upgrade head.